abstract: >-
  Code, data manifests, pre-registration briefs (with OpenTimestamps proofs) and
  per-session results for a pre-registered measurement of what one mean vector
  loses when it stands for a folder of mixed files, and what a folder's few
  kilobytes of metadata can store instead.
